---
title: "Nightingale engine lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: runs today
    lg1: attention
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 orange
  s0: Map declared
  s1: Map checked and hashed
  s2: Not admitted
  s3: Body compiled
  s4: Parameters bound
  s5: Run at an accepted state
  s6: Step proposed
  s7: Engine fault, run stopped
  s8: Step refused
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the map passes its checks
  s0 --> s2: a map check fails
  s1 --> s3: organ laws compile into one body
  s1 --> s2: compilation rejects a law
  s3 --> s4: a packet binds to the body
  s3 --> s2: the packet does not bind
  s4 --> s5: admission solves the start state
  s4 --> s2: admission fails
  s5 --> s6: the solver proposes a step
  s6 --> s5: accepted whole
  s6 --> s7: the solver or model cannot go on
  s6 --> s8: refused whole, nothing changes
  s7 --> s5: recover on a new branch from an earlier checkpoint
  s8 --> s6: retry over a shorter interval
  s8 --> s7: no shorter interval is left
  class s0 teal
  class s1 teal
  class s2 orange
  class s3 teal
  class s4 teal
  class s5 teal
  class s6 teal
  class s7 orange
  class s8 orange
